    </div>
    <div class="rv">
      <span class="mono" style="color:var(--red)">\ The giving side</span>
      <h3 style="font-weight:var(--dispw);font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase;margin:14px 0 18px">Some stories are not <span class="serif" style="font-family:var(--serif,'Instrument Serif',serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-transform:none">for sale.</span></h3>
      <p style="color:#4c4a45;max-width:52ch;margin-bottom:1em">We have carried cameras through Nepal, Uganda, and across Europe for work that was never about selling anything. Those trips taught us patience, respect for the subject, and how to disappear so a true story can show up.</p>
      <p style="color:#4c4a45;max-width:52ch">We still take that work when it matters, and we bring everything that pressure taught us to it.</p>
      <a class="giveBtn" href="/giving">Giving back <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
